---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Container from "../components/Container.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../components/Eyebrow.astro";

const updated = "June 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cove: Ocean Puzzles — Privacy Policy"
  description="How the Cove: Ocean Puzzles mobile game collects, uses, and protects information."
>
  <section class="pt-24 md:pt-32 pb-10">
    <Container size="default">
      <Eyebrow>Legal</Eyebrow>
      <h1 class="mt-6 display-xl text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)]">Cove Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede mt-6">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </Container>
  </section>

  <section class="pb-24 md:pb-32">
    <Container size="default">
      <div class="prose-legal max-w-2xl space-y-10 text-graphite leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          This policy explains how Tiffany Russell Studio LLC ("elefox studio,"
          "we," "us," or "our") handles information in connection with the mobile
          game <strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Cove: Ocean Puzzles</strong>
          (the "App"). It is separate from our website privacy policy. We built
          Cove to respect your privacy: there are no accounts to create, and we
          do not ask you for any personal information.
        </p>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Information we collect</h2>
          <ul class="mt-2 space-y-2 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Information you provide:</strong>
              none. The App has no sign-up, login, or account system, and we do
              not collect names, email addresses, or contact details.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Game progress:</strong> your
              scores, collection, streaks, and settings are stored locally on your
              device only. We do not upload or have access to this data, and
              deleting the App removes it.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-ink font-semibold">Advertising data (via Google AdMob):</strong>
              the App displays ads through Google AdMob. To serve ads, Google may
              collect a device advertising identifier, IP address, and limited
              usage and interaction data. We request non-personalized ads where
              possible. We do not receive or store this data ourselves.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Advertising</h2>
          <p>
            Ads are provided by Google AdMob, whose handling of data is governed
            by Google's own policies:
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-forest underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ember">Google Privacy Policy</a>
            and
            <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-forest underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ember">how Google uses information from partner apps</a>.
            You can limit ad personalization at any time in your device settings
            (iOS: Settings &rarr; Privacy &amp; Security &rarr; Tracking / Apple
            Advertising; Android: Settings &rarr; Google &rarr; Ads).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">How we use information</h2>
          <p>
            To run the game and remember your progress on your device, and — by
            Google AdMob — to display and measure ads within the App. We do not
            sell your personal information, and we do not use your data to build
            advertising profiles about you.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">How we share it</h2>
          <p>
            We do not sell or rent personal information. The only third party that
            processes data in connection with the App is Google (AdMob), solely to
            serve ads as described above. We may also disclose information if
            required by law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Children</h2>
          <p>
            Cove is intended for a general audience and is not directed to children
            under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from
            children, and ads served in the App are configured as non-personalized.
            If you believe a child has provided personal information, contact us and
            we will address it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Data retention and security</h2>
          <p>
            Game data lives on your device and is removed when you delete the App.
            Advertising data is retained by Google according to its policies. We use
            reasonable measures appropriate to a game that collects no personal data
            directly. No method of transmission over the internet is completely
            secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Your choices</h2>
          <p>
            You can reset all game data by deleting and reinstalling the App, and
            you can control ad personalization through your device's advertising
            settings described above.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this policy as the App evolves. When we do, we will change
            the "last updated" date above.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl text-ink font-display font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Contact us</h2>
          <p>Questions about this policy or your information? Reach us at:</p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Tiffany Russell Studio LLC (elefox studio)<br />
            Coral Springs, FL<br />
            <a href="mailto:hello@elefoxstudio.com" class="text-forest underline decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-ember">hello@elefoxstudio.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
